<title>USA: Host Marriott Q3 shr loss narrows to $0.01.</title>
<headline>Host Marriott Q3 shr loss narrows to $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr  loss	 $0.01	     loss $0.03</p>
<p> Net  loss	 2,000	     loss 5,000</p>
<p> Revs		167,000		  110,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  194,800		  158,800</p>
<p>Nine months ended Sept. 6Nine months ended Sept.8</p>
<p> Shr	loss   $0.04	     loss $0.31</p>
<p> Net	loss   7,000	     loss 49,000</p>
<p> Revs		464,000		  319,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  183,100		  157,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company reported third quarter EBITDA was $101 million, a 58 percent increase over the year-ago EBITDA figure of $64 million.</p>
<p>On operating results for the quarter, the company reported a $0.01 per share loss on $2 million net loss from continuing operations, compared to a $0.02 per share loss on $4 million net loss from continuing operations.</p>
</text>
